    "description_zh": "在挽叻的昭披耶河邊，CAT Tower 碼頭旁的 Bangrak Riverview 裡，新開不久。座位直接面河，對岸就是 ICONSIAM，光線好，能拍照的角落很多。除了咖啡和甜點也賣正餐，有炸雞配青木瓜沙拉和烤牛肉，飲料可以點 Iced Matcha Latte。",
    "description_en": "A new cafe on the Chao Phraya in Bang Rak, inside Bangrak Riverview next to CAT Tower pier. Seats face the river with ICONSIAM right across, the light is good and there are plenty of corners for photos. Besides coffee and desserts it serves proper meals, including fried chicken with papaya salad and grilled beef. For a drink, go for the Iced Matcha Latte.",
