    "name_zh": "Light Minute Home Cafe",
    "description_zh": "在 Prawet 區 Chaloem Phrakiat Ro 9 路的 39/2 巷，離九世皇公園很近。小小一間，被綠樹包圍，室內和戶外都有座位。抹茶系列做得好，Iced Matcha Lemonade 很受歡迎，咖啡也穩。餐點是家常口味，巧克力蛋糕值得點。有停車位，開車去很方便。",
    "description_en": "On Soi 39/2 of Chaloem Phrakiat Ro 9 Road in Prawet, close to Suan Luang Rama IX park. It is a small place surrounded by trees, with seating both indoors and outside. The matcha drinks are the strong point, the Iced Matcha Lemonade is a favourite, and the coffee is reliable too. Food is home-style cooking and the chocolate cake is worth ordering. There is parking, so it is easy to reach by car.",
