    "description_zh": "在沙吞的 Soi Si Bamphen，剛開不久的小店。招牌是布里歐捲，麵包體很軟、奶油香氣足，上面搭不同的配料，可以先試 Whipped Cheese & Berry Sauce 這個口味，另外也有無花果配奶油起司的款式。飲料有抹茶。店面不大，裝潢很用心。",
    "description_en": "A small shop that recently opened on Soi Si Bamphen in Sathorn. The specialty is brioche rolls: the bread is very soft and buttery, finished with different toppings. Start with the Whipped Cheese & Berry Sauce roll, and there is also a fig and cream cheese version. Matcha is on the drinks list. The space is small but carefully designed.",
