    "name_zh": "SUPER NICE LAND.BKK",
    "description_zh": "在素坤逸路 Cloud 11 的二樓，是咖啡店也是選物店，店裡賣衣服、配件和小物，到處貼著正向的標語，能拍照的角落不少。招牌 Super Nice Coffee 加了自製氣泡水，喝起來接近橙香咖啡。抹茶拿鐵用京都的抹茶粉，上桌時會附一張風味小卡。",
    "description_en": "On the second floor of Cloud 11 on Sukhumvit Road, this is a cafe and a select shop in one, selling clothes, accessories and small goods. Upbeat quotes are posted all over the space and there are plenty of spots for photos. The signature Super Nice Coffee is made with house-made soda and tastes close to an orange coffee. The matcha latte uses Kyoto matcha and comes with a small flavour note card.",
