    "description_zh": "在曼谷藝術文化中心（BACC）三樓，BTS National Stadium 站旁邊，逛展覽時順路就到。咖啡有幾款豆子可以選，淺焙的香氣很好。不喝咖啡可以點抹茶，或是招牌的 Thai Tea Honey Bee。座位有插座，適合坐下來休息一下。",
    "description_en": "On the third floor of the Bangkok Art and Culture Centre (BACC), right by BTS National Stadium, so it is an easy stop while visiting the exhibitions. There are several coffee beans to choose from and the light roast is nicely fragrant. If you do not drink coffee, order matcha or the signature Thai Tea Honey Bee. Seats have power outlets, which makes it a good place to take a break.",
