    "id": "df49a04a-40ec-46aa-94fd-40f2f21524d9",
    "name_en": "The Langham, Custom House, Bangkok",
    "name_zh": "The Langham, Custom House, Bangkok",
    "description_zh": "在挽叻的昭披耶河畔，由 1888 年落成的舊海關大樓修復改建，是朗廷集團在泰國的第一家飯店，預計 2026 年 12 月 20 日開始接待住客。共 75 間客房與套房，新建的玻璃帷幕客房棟由泰國建築師 Smith Obayawat 設計。館內會有香港粵菜餐廳唐閣（T'ang Court）的分店、酒吧、戶外泳池和川水療。",
    "description_en": "On the Chao Phraya riverfront in Bang Rak, restored from the old Custom House completed in 1888. It is the Langham group's first hotel in Thailand and is due to welcome guests from 20 December 2026. There are 75 rooms and suites, and the new glass-walled guest wing was designed by Thai architect Smith Obayawat. The hotel will house an outpost of Hong Kong's Cantonese restaurant T'ang Court, a bar, an outdoor pool and Chuan Spa.",
