    "id": "ee85ae05-c56d-4a72-a7ce-9e330b2d0fe5",
    "name_en": "Segreto Exclusive Italian by Ermanno Lelli",
    "name_zh": "Segreto Exclusive Italian by Ermanno Lelli",
    "description_zh": "主廚 Ermanno Lelli 的義大利餐廳，在素坤逸 26 巷新開的店面。走主廚餐桌的形式，一小群人圍著吃，主廚會邊做邊講每道菜的故事，現場有音樂，整晚像參加一場聚會。義大利麵是現做的，Signature Pistachio Tiramisu 和照主廚媽媽食譜做的拿坡里烤肉卷 Polpettone 值得點。要先訂位。",
    "description_en": "Chef Ermanno Lelli's Italian restaurant, now in a new space on Sukhumvit Soi 26. It runs as a chef's table: a small group eats together while the chef cooks and tells the story behind each dish, with music playing, so the evening feels like a gathering. The pasta is made fresh, and the Signature Pistachio Tiramisu and the Neapolitan baked polpettone from his mother's recipe are worth ordering. Book ahead.",
