  {
    "id": "9500f7e3-d2ee-4996-a3a3-474b26dbab73",
    "name_en": "Brass House Bangkok",
    "name_zh": "Brass House Bangkok",
    "description_zh": "在 Ratchadamri 路 Grande Centre Point Prestige 飯店的 45 樓，是有現場爵士樂的餐廳酒吧，裝潢走紐約老派爵士俱樂部的路線，窗外是曼谷夜景。固定有樂手和歌手駐場演出。菜是新派泰式料理，適合幾個人分著吃，炸蛋料理 Khai Sa Phai 值得點，調酒也做得好。建議先訂位。",
    "description_en": "On the 45th floor of the Grande Centre Point Prestige hotel on Ratchadamri Road, this is a restaurant and bar with live jazz. The room is styled after an old-school New York jazz club, with the Bangkok skyline outside the windows, and there is a regular lineup of musicians and singers. The food is contemporary Thai, made for sharing. The fried egg dish Khai Sa Phai is worth ordering and the cocktails are well made. Booking ahead is recommended.",
